### ==================== Stage 7 Exception / Audit / Filtering / Pagination ====================

# 前置條件：
# 1. 沿用 Stage 5 的 manual-test profile、rmToken 與 reviewerToken。
# 2. stage7CompanyId 必須是已存在的 Company ID。
# 3. 每次 CREATE 後，將 response 的 id 貼到對應 application 變數。
# 4. APPROVE 完成後，以本文末 SQL 查出 CreditLimit ID，再填入 stage7CreditLimitId。
# 5. DRAWDOWN 完成後，將 response 的 id 填入 stage7DrawdownId。

@stage7CompanyId = 19
@stage7ApproveApplicationId = 0
@stage7RejectApplicationId = 13
@stage7CreditLimitId = 4
@stage7DrawdownId = 0
@stage7MissingApplicationId = 999999999


### 1. CreditApplication 分頁查全部 — expected 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/credit-applications?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}


### 2. status filtering — expected 200，content 只包含 SUBMITTED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/credit-applications?status=SUBMITTED&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{reviewerToken}}


### 3. Spring Data sort — expected 200，createdAt 由新到舊
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/credit-applications?page=0&size=10&sort=createdAt,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{reviewerToken}}


### 4. 非法 status — expected 400，使用 Stage 7.1 ApiErrorResponse
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/credit-applications?status=UNKNOWN&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}


### 5. 非法 page — expected 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/credit-applications?page=-1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}


### 6. 非法 size — expected 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/credit-applications?page=0&size=0
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}


### 7. size 超過 100 — expected 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/credit-applications?page=0&size=101
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}


### 8. ResourceNotFoundException — expected 404，且不得新增 audit log
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/credit-applications/{{stage7MissingApplicationId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}


### 9. Bean Validation error — expected 400，validationErrors 包含 name 與 taxId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/companies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "taxId": "123"
}


