### 18. 超額 Drawdown BusinessRuleException — expected 409，且不得新增 CREATE_DRAWDOWN audit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/credit-limits/{{stage7CreditLimitId}}/drawdowns
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 999999999.00
}


### 19. Audit verification SQL（請在 psql／DB client 執行）
# SELECT id, actor_username, action, entity_type, entity_id, created_at
# FROM audit_logs
# WHERE (entity_type = 'CREDIT_APPLICATION'
#        AND entity_id IN (<stage7ApproveApplicationId>, <stage7RejectApplicationId>))
#    OR (entity_type = 'DRAWDOWN' AND entity_id = <stage7DrawdownId>)
# ORDER BY id;

# 預期 actor/action：
# stage5_rm       / CREATE_CREDIT_APPLICATION  / CREDIT_APPLICATION / approve application ID
# stage5_rm       / SUBMIT_CREDIT_APPLICATION  / CREDIT_APPLICATION / approve application ID（只能一筆）
# stage5_reviewer / APPROVE_CREDIT_APPLICATION / CREDIT_APPLICATION / approve application ID
# stage5_rm       / CREATE_CREDIT_APPLICATION  / CREDIT_APPLICATION / reject application ID
# stage5_rm       / SUBMIT_CREDIT_APPLICATION  / CREDIT_APPLICATION / reject application ID
# stage5_reviewer / REJECT_CREDIT_APPLICATION  / CREDIT_APPLICATION / reject application ID
# stage5_rm       / CREATE_DRAWDOWN             / DRAWDOWN           / drawdown ID


### 20. 失敗 action 不得留下成功 audit（請在 DB client 執行）
# 重複 Submit 失敗後，下列 count 必須仍為 1：
# SELECT COUNT(*)
# FROM audit_logs
# WHERE actor_username = 'stage5_rm'
#   AND action = 'SUBMIT_CREDIT_APPLICATION'
#   AND entity_type = 'CREDIT_APPLICATION'
#   AND entity_id = <stage7ApproveApplicationId>;

# 超額 Drawdown 前後，可用下列 SQL 比對；count 不得增加：
# SELECT COUNT(*)
# FROM audit_logs
# WHERE actor_username = 'stage5_rm'
#   AND action = 'CREATE_DRAWDOWN';
### ==================== Stage 9 - Manual Final Verification ====================

# 執行前置條件：
# 1. 使用 manual-test profile 啟動：
#    .\mvnw.cmd spring-boot:run "-Dspring-boot.run.profiles=manual-test"
# 2. 確認 PostgreSQL 已套用 Flyway V1～V7。
# 3. 依序執行 Stage 9 requests；named requests 會提供 JWT 與 ID response variables。
# 4. CreditLimit 目前沒有查詢 API，Drawdown 前需以 SQL 查出 ID。

### 1. Health check — expected 200 / OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health


### 2. 建立 Stage 9 Company — expected 200；Company API 目前為 public
